	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r1001_waitress_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さっきの　なきごえモノマネは
あなたが　つれている▽
どの　ポケモン　だったでしょう？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さっきの　鳴き声モノマネは
あなたが　連れている▽
どの　ポケモン　だったでしょう？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:35:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：White2ver
・選択肢表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:22:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WAITRESS</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T08:43:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r1001_waitress_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいかい　でーす！▼
いつも　きいている　ポケモンの
なきごえを　わかりますよね！▼
あそんでくれて　ありがとうなの！
これ　くだらないけど　どうぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>正解でーす！▼
いつも　きいている　ポケモンの
鳴き声なら　わかりますよね！▼
遊んでくれて　ありがとうなの！
これ　くだらないけど　どうぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：White2ver
・正解１回目
・正解SE再生後にメッセージ表示
・アイテム入手処理
　No577「ポケじゃらし」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:22:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WAITRESS</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T08:43:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r1001_waitress_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいかい　でーす！▼
ですよね！　パートナ－の　なきごえを
まちがったりなんて　ないですよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>正解でーす！▼
ですよね！　パートナ－の　鳴き声を
間違ったりなんて　ないですよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：White2ver
・正解２回目以降
・正解SE再生後にメッセージ表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:22:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WAITRESS</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:52:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T08:43:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r1001_waitress_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おしい！　くやしい！　かなしいです！
いまのは　[Name:PokemonName ]　でした！</Text>
